{"seq":1,"slug":"presale-conversion-deposit-tail","title":"预售转化、定金转化与弃尾款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/presale-ops-metric/presale-conversion-deposit-tail","wordCount":2085,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"预售转化-定金转化与弃尾款\">预售转化、定金转化与弃尾款</h1><p>一次预售的用户旅程比现货长得多：曝光 → 详情页 → 付定金 → 等待生产 → 付尾款 → 收货。每一个环节都在流失用户，而且流失的<strong>性质不同</strong>——详情页流失是兴趣不足，付定金后流失是决策摇摆，付尾款前流失是需求消失或竞品出现。把它们混成一个&quot;转化率&quot;会让运营看不出该改哪一环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>预售漏斗需要五个独立的口径，而不是一个。它们的定义一旦混淆，任何优化都会指向错误的环节。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>分子</th>\n<th>分母</th>\n<th>反映</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>详情页转化率</td>\n<td>付定金订单数</td>\n<td>详情页 UV</td>\n<td>商品与定价吸引力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定金转化率</td>\n<td>付定金订单数</td>\n<td>加购/意向用户数</td>\n<td>定金门槛是否过高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾款转化率</td>\n<td>付尾款订单数</td>\n<td>应付尾款订单数</td>\n<td>履约信心与竞品冲击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弃尾款率</td>\n<td>超时未付尾款订单数</td>\n<td>应付尾款订单数</td>\n<td>上面一者的补数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预售终局成交率</td>\n<td>净成交金额</td>\n<td>曝光或 UV</td>\n<td>端到端效率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意&quot;弃尾款率&quot;与&quot;尾款转化率&quot;是互补的，但它们的分母必须是<strong>进入尾款窗口的订单</strong>，而不是全量付定金订单。把分母写成后者会低估这个比率，掩盖弃付问题的严重程度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[详情页 UV] --&gt; B[付定金]&#10;    B --&gt; C[进入尾款窗口]&#10;    C --&gt; D{支付尾款?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[净成交]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[弃尾款: 定金没收或退还]&#10;    E --&gt; G{发货后?}&#10;    G --&gt;|签收| H[终局成交]&#10;    G --&gt;|退款| I[终局流失]&#10;    C --&gt; J[窗口内取消]&#10;    J --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[详情页 UV] --&gt; B[付定金]\n    B --&gt; C[进入尾款窗口]\n    C --&gt; D{支付尾款?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[净成交]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[弃尾款: 定金没收或退还]\n    E --&gt; G{发货后?}\n    G --&gt;|签收| H[终局成交]\n    G --&gt;|退款| I[终局流失]\n    C --&gt; J[窗口内取消]\n    J --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"弃尾款的行为归因\">弃尾款的行为归因</h2><h3 id=\"三种弃付动机\">三种弃付动机</h3><p>弃付不是一种行为，至少三种动机需要分开处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>价格失效型</strong>：等待期间竞品降价或本商品现货打折，锁定的价格不再有吸引力。这是锁价设计（见 <a href=\"../presale-model/price-lock-demand-aggregation\">锁单价保与需求聚合</a>）的直接副作用。</li>\n<li><strong>需求消失型</strong>：冲动下单后需求消失，尤其是定金金额低的时候——50 元的决策成本几乎为零，但它不代表真实需求。</li>\n<li><strong>体验受损型</strong>：等待期间发生了延期通知、客服纠纷或负面舆情，用户主动放弃。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三种动机的应对完全不同：价格失效型要靠锁价条款与到货提醒，需求消失型要靠提高定金门槛或引入无理由退定，体验受损型要靠服务补救。归因方式是把弃付订单与等待期间的事件流做关联。</p>\n<h3 id=\"定金门槛与弃付率的权衡\">定金门槛与弃付率的权衡</h3><p>定金金额是弃付率最直接的杠杆。定金越高，冲动下单越少，弃付率越低，但付定金转化率也越低。这是一个显式的权衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>净期望</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>deposit</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>tail</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>margin</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{净期望} = N_{\\text{deposit}}(d) \\cdot P_{\\text{tail}}(d) \\cdot \\text{margin}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">净期望</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deposit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tail</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">margin</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中定金金额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 同时影响付定金人数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>deposit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{deposit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deposit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（递减）与尾款支付概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>tail</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{tail}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tail</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（递增）。最优 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 在两者的乘积最大处，而不是任一极值处。实践中这个最优点通常落在&quot;定金约等于售价的 5%-15%&quot;的区间，但必须用自己活动的数据拟合，不能照搬。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定金确认与提醒的状态设计\">定金确认与提醒的状态设计</h2><p>尾款窗口的运营不是&quot;到点发通知&quot;，而是一组有状态的动作序列。用一张表记录每个订单在窗口内的推进情况，才能知道&quot;这个用户在第几次提醒后仍然没付&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE tail_reminder (&#10;  order_id       BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  offset_kind    TEXT NOT NULL&#10;                 CHECK (offset_kind IN (&#39;WINDOW_OPEN&#39;,&#39;D_MINUS_3&#39;,&#39;D_MINUS_1&#39;,&#39;WINDOW_CLOSE&#39;)),&#10;  scheduled_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  sent_at        TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  clicked_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  paid_after    BOOLEAN,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (order_id, offset_kind)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_tail_reminder_due&#10;  ON tail_reminder (scheduled_at)&#10;  WHERE sent_at IS NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tail_reminder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  offset_kind    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (offset_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WINDOW_OPEN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'D_MINUS_3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'D_MINUS_1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WINDOW_CLOSE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scheduled_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sent_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  clicked_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  paid_after    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, offset_kind)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_tail_reminder_due</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tail_reminder (scheduled_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sent_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>paid_after</code> 让提醒序列的效果可被衡量——如果 <code>D_MINUS_1</code> 这档提醒的付费提升接近于零，就该删掉它，因为每一条提醒都在消耗用户的注意力预算。部分索引 <code>WHERE sent_at IS NULL</code> 让待发扫描不受已发历史的影响。</p>\n<h3 id=\"提醒的时点选择\">提醒的时点选择</h3><p>尾款窗口的提醒有四个标准时点：窗口开启、到期前 3 天、到期前 1 天、窗口关闭前数小时。最后一条最容易打折——它在用户已经决定不买时触发，转化率低而投诉率高（用户会觉得被催）。但它也捕捉了&quot;忘了付&quot;这一类，这类用户的转化率反而很高。</p>\n<p>区分这两类的方法是看<strong>点击行为</strong>：如果用户点击了提醒但没有支付，说明他在评估；如果连点都没点，说明他已经失去兴趣。前者值得再提醒一次，后者不该再打扰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"终局成交率的正确算法\">终局成交率的正确算法</h2><p>终局成交率必须把弃付、取消、退款全部计入净额，否则会系统性高估活动的真实表现。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>终局成交率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>净成交金额</mtext><mtext>曝光 UV</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{终局成交率} = \\frac{\\text{净成交金额}}{\\text{曝光 UV}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">终局成交率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">曝光</span><span class=\"mord\"> UV</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">净成交金额</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>净成交金额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>收讫金额</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>退款</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>赔付</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{净成交金额} = \\text{收讫金额} - \\text{退款} - \\text{赔付}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">净成交金额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收讫金额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">退款</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">赔付</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个扣减项缺一不可。只看&quot;收讫金额&quot;会把活动期间收到的钱当作成绩，而其中一部分会在延期赔付与退款中吐回去。这也是为什么赔付表与退款表必须独立存在——没有它们，终局成交率无法计算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;  c.campaign_id,&#10;  SUM(o.paid_amount)                                        AS gross_collected,&#10;  COALESCE(SUM(r.refunded_amount), 0)                       AS refunded,&#10;  COALESCE(SUM(k.paid_amount), 0)                            AS compensated,&#10;  SUM(o.paid_amount) - COALESCE(SUM(r.refunded_amount), 0)&#10;    - COALESCE(SUM(k.paid_amount), 0)                        AS net_revenue,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE o.end_state = &#39;CLOSED_FORFEIT&#39;)     AS forfeited_orders,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE o.end_state = &#39;TAIL_PAID&#39;)          AS completed_orders&#10;FROM presale_order o&#10;JOIN presale_campaign c USING (campaign_id)&#10;LEFT JOIN (SELECT order_id, SUM(amount) AS refunded_amount&#10;           FROM refund_record GROUP BY order_id) r USING (order_id)&#10;LEFT JOIN (SELECT order_id, SUM(amount) AS paid_amount&#10;           FROM delay_compensation&#10;           WHERE state IN (&#39;APPLIED&#39;) GROUP BY order_id) k USING (order_id)&#10;WHERE c.campaign_id = $1&#10;GROUP BY c.campaign_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gross_collected,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">refunded_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> refunded,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">k</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compensated,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">refunded_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">k</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">end_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CLOSED_FORFEIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> forfeited_orders,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">end_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'TAIL_PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> completed_orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presale_order o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presale_campaign c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (campaign_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> refunded_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> refund_record </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id) r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> paid_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delay_compensation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'APPLIED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id) k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE ...)</code> 让同一个扫描同时产出两个分状态的计数，避免为每个状态各跑一次聚合。这是把多指标报表压缩成单次查询的标准手法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定金没收的运营决策\">定金没收的运营决策</h2><p>弃付产生一个运营问题：定金要不要没收。这与法律约束（见 <a href=\"../presale-model/deposit-refundability-regulation\">定金可退性</a>）强相关，但即使在允许没收的市场，也应当权衡：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>没收</strong>：补偿了产能占用成本，但会显著提高用户投诉，降低下一次预售的付定金意愿。</li>\n<li><strong>退还</strong>：用户好感度高，但商家承担了全部产能风险，&quot;随意占位&quot;的行为会被鼓励。</li>\n<li><strong>折中</strong>：退还但扣除已发生的实际成本，或转为下次可用的抵扣券。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在跨境场景下，扣押定金的合规边界比国内窄。欧盟的消费者保护框架把远程合同的取消权、预合同信息披露与附加支付的主动同意作为强制内容，并对不符合约定的商品规定了从修理更换到退款、减价、解除合同的分层救济，商业条款不能削弱这些法定权利（见 <a href=\"https://europa.eu/youreurope/citizens/consumers/shopping/guarantees-returns/index_en.htm\">https://europa.eu/youreurope/citizens/consumers/shopping/guarantees-returns/index_en.htm</a> ）。因此&quot;没收定金&quot;通常只能在定金被明确定义为具有惩罚性、且法域允许的前提下成立，并且在撤回权窗口内一律无效。</p>\n<p>抵扣券是工程上最省事的一种折中：它在资金上不退款（保留现金），在用户感受上给出补偿，代价是引入了一个跨活动的券负债。如果选这条路径，券的发行必须与订单绑定并且唯一，否则重放会产生多张券。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uq_forfeit_coupon_per_order&#10;  ON forfeit_coupon (order_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uq_forfeit_coupon_per_order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> forfeit_coupon (order_id);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"指标的下钻维度\">指标的下钻维度</h2><p>同一组指标必须能按三个维度下钻，否则无法归因：<strong>批次</strong>（生产批次，反映供应侧质量）、<strong>品类</strong>（反映定价与需求特性）、<strong>市场</strong>（反映跨境履约差异）。三个维度在数据模型上分别对应不同的外键，应当在订单宽表上就带齐。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>下钻维度</th>\n<th>关键字段</th>\n<th>典型发现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>批次</td>\n<td><code>batch_id</code></td>\n<td>某批次延期导致该批次弃付率显著更高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类</td>\n<td><code>category_id</code></td>\n<td>高单价品类定金门槛偏高导致转化低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场</td>\n<td><code>delivery_market</code></td>\n<td>某市场尾程慢导致体验受损型弃付集中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>预售漏斗需要五个独立口径，弃尾款率的分母必须是进入尾款窗口的订单。</li>\n<li>弃付至少三种动机（价格失效、需求消失、体验受损），应对方式完全不同。</li>\n<li>定金金额在转化与弃付之间存在显式权衡，最优值在乘积最大处而非任一极值。</li>\n<li>尾款提醒是有状态的序列，用 <code>paid_after</code> 衡量每档提醒的真实效果。</li>\n<li>终局成交率必须扣除退款与赔付，否则会系统性高估活动表现。</li>\n<li>定金没收是法律与运营的双重决策；折中方案（抵扣券）需要按订单唯一发行。</li>\n<li>指标必须能按批次、品类、市场三维下钻，三个外键应在订单宽表上带齐。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>预售与营销活动、秒杀的编排边界见 <a href=\"presale-vs-flash-campaign-boundary\">预售与秒杀/活动的协同与边界</a>；需求信号的准确度如何评估见 <a href=\"presale-demand-forecast-accuracy\">预售需求信号与预测准确率</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预售转化、定金转化与弃尾款","id":"预售转化-定金转化与弃尾款"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"弃尾款的行为归因","id":"弃尾款的行为归因"},{"level":3,"text":"三种弃付动机","id":"三种弃付动机"},{"level":3,"text":"定金门槛与弃付率的权衡","id":"定金门槛与弃付率的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"定金确认与提醒的状态设计","id":"定金确认与提醒的状态设计"},{"level":3,"text":"提醒的时点选择","id":"提醒的时点选择"},{"level":2,"text":"终局成交率的正确算法","id":"终局成交率的正确算法"},{"level":2,"text":"定金没收的运营决策","id":"定金没收的运营决策"},{"level":2,"text":"指标的下钻维度","id":"指标的下钻维度"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"需求不确定下的供应与超卖防控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/crowdfunding-goal-risk/presale-demand-uncertainty-supply"},"next":{"title":"预售与秒杀/活动的协同与边界（联 032/061）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/presale-ops-metric/presale-vs-flash-campaign-boundary"}}